# coll. Woestenburg, AfO 44/45 (1997/1998) p.354 instead of isz#?-me-[...]-utu 
6. _igi_ akszak#[{ki}-i-din]-nam _dumu#_ [...]-qi2-in-ni 
# coll. Woestenburg, AfO 44/45 (1997/1998) p.354 instead of x x [...]-nam 
7. _igi_ {d}suen-[i]-din#-nam _dumu_ {d}utu#-[illat]-su2 
